 the race in the Safe or Solid Republican column, and prediction markets give Capito about a 98 percent chance of winning.\n\nNo general-election polling is available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals, money, and ratings, all of which point the same way. A third-party candidate on the ballot is unlikely to be a factor. The race is expected to be decided by a wide Republican margin.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.008, "margin": -17.55}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0111, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0053, "margin": -18.0}]}